*HEADING
Crown gear / carrier laser weld - stress analysis, restart of bimaterial_RLS_Press: WELD (375 increments, 2 x thermal dt) + COOLING 300 s, symmetric solver, NLGEOM=NO
** Restart job: launch with oldjob=bimaterial_RLS_Press; temperatures from bimaterial_RLS_Thermal.fil
** (job name of the thermal run). Stress increment = 2 x the thermal dt (0.046076692252 s); symmetric solver,
** NLGEOM=NO. Linear tets (C3D4), hex region C3D8.
*RESTART, READ, STEP=1
**
*STEP, NAME=WELD, NLGEOM=NO, INC=3000
